{"id":71344,"date":"2026-10-29T19:31:53","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:31:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71344"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:33:40","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:33:40","slug":"trail-vouga-do-diabo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-vouga-do-diabo\/","title":{"rendered":"II Trail Vouga do Diabo 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">II Trail Vouga do Diabo 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>II Trail Vouga do Diabo 2027<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de Maio de 2027<\/strong> (Ter\u00e7a-feira), com partida agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> em <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. A prova regressa ao cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Laf\u00f5es para desafiar os amantes do trail running nos trilhos ribeirinhos e serranos da bacia do rio Vouga.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento compreende quatro vertentes ajustadas a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: o <strong>Trail Longo de 26 km<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto de 16 km<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini-Trail de 11 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong>. Os percursos tiram partido da geografia imponente de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul, concelho c\u00e9lebre pelas suas termas milenares e enquadrado pelas encostas xistosas das serras da Arada, S\u00e3o Mac\u00e1rio e Gralheira. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Maio de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4p